    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d134">

                <pb facs="0289" n="275" sameAs="frus:frus1950v06/pg275"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.7146/1–1050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Consulate General at Peiping
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret   niact
                        </hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-01-10T18:00:00-05:00">January 10, 1950—6
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>25. Eyes only Clubb. Deptel 22 Jan 10.<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d134-f1"/> If ur Brit colleague does not receive FonOff instrs prior expiration time limit, you
                    shld at last, resort arrange direct or indirect means bring to attn Chou En-lai
                    or other Commie official views and intentions US Govt to ensure Commies not move
                    against US Govt property without full realization inevitable results such
                    action.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d134-f1" n="1" xml:id="d134-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed. It advised Mr. Clubb that he should immediately smuggle out or
                    secretly destroy the post’s confidential files or reduce them to a minimum
                    capable of destruction at the last moment and should also remove the code
                    materials to a safe place. (125.7146/1–1050)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
